Hello,

I am transferring a new version of the babel 3.7 release over to
Mainz right now. I expect it to arrive there by mirror this weekend.

My intention is that this is the final release; I put at Mainz first
just to see if any of you guys can find anything wrong with it.
If nothing major comes up this week I intend to transfer this release
onto CTAN where it will finally supersede (long overdue) release 3.6.
On Thursday, September 28 jlbraams wrote:

Just as a reminder: you can find it at
ftp://ftp.uni-mainz.de/pub/tex/macros/latex/required/babel/3.7-beta.

If you find any problems, please report them via the bugs address:
mailto:latex-bugs@latex-project.org using latexbug.tex
Reporting this way helps me keeping track of what I have done and what
has yet to be attacked.

Kind regrads,

Johannes Braams

